s-to-do\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Things to Do</span></span></a></li><li><a class=\"gh-menu__link\" href=\"/guests/ask-us\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Ask Us</span></span></a></li><li><div class=\"account-menu account-menu--inline\" role=\"group\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_1jr39bn5ritnknelb_\"><p id=\"_R_1jr39bn5ritnknelb_\" class=\"account-menu__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Your account</span></p><ul class=\"account-menu__list\"><li><a class=\"gh-menu__link\" href=\"/photos\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Photos &amp; Video</span></a></li><li><a class=\"gh-menu__link\" href=\"/sign-out\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Sign out</span></a></li></ul></div></li></ul></div></div></dialog></div><span hidden=\"\" data-nav-fit=\"whole\"></span></nav></header><main id=\"main\" class=\"gh-main\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-bl-k=\"main\" data-bl-label=\"Getting to Chicago\"><header class=\"gh-pagehead\" data-bl-k=\"header\" data-bl-label=\"Getting to Chicago\"><div class=\"gh-pagehead__inner\"><p class=\"gh-eyebrow\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Travel &amp; Stay</span></p><hr class=\"gh-divider\" data-bl-s=\"\"><h1 class=\"gh-h gh-h--1 gh-pagehead__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Getting to Chicago</span></h1><p class=\"gh-lede gh-pagehead__lede\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We know many of you will be traveling to join us, and we’re grateful you’re making the trip. Here’s some helpful information to make planning your stay a little easier. We’ll add more details as our plans come together.</span></p></div></header><section id=\"arriving\" class=\"gh-section gh-section--default\" aria-labelledby=\"arriving-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Getting to Chicago\"><div class=\"gh-section__inner\"><div class=\"gh-section__head\"><hr class=\"gh-divider\" data-bl-s=\"\"><h2 id=\"arriving-title\" class=\"gh-h gh-h--2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Getting to Chicago</span></h2></div><div class=\"gh-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We recommend flying into O'Hare (ORD). There is no wedding shuttle; take the CTA Blue Line “L” train into downtown. Visit the</span><!-- --> <a class=\"gh-link\" href=\"https://www.transitchicago.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Chicago Transit Authority</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"gh-external\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M14 4h6v6M20 4l-9 9M18 13v7H4V6h7\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">, opens in a new tab</span></span></a><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> for routes and service information.</span></p><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Rideshare pickup details at the airport are coming soon. Uber can take you from the airport to the hotel.</span></p><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Midway (MDW) also serves Chicago with trains, taxis, and rideshare into downtown.</span></p><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">By train: </span><a class=\"gh-link\" href=\"https://www.amtrak.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Amtrak</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"gh-external\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M14 4h6v6M20 4l-9 9M18 13v7H4V6h7\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">, opens in a new tab</span></span></a><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> serves Chicago's Union Station from cities throughout the country.</span></p><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">By car: valet parking is $84 per night with in-and-out privileges at the 71 E Madison entrance. Millennium Park Garage (6 S. Columbus Dr.) and Millennium Lakeside Garage (5 S. Columbus Dr.) are nearby alternatives. Check </span><a class=\"gh-link\" href=\"https://www.millenniumgarages.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Millennium Garages</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"gh-external\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M14 4h6v6M20 4l-9 9M18 13v7H4V6h7\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">, opens in a new tab</span></span></a><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> for current rates and reservations. Parking rates and availability may change before the wedding.</span></p><p><a class=\"gh-link gh-link--standalone\" href=\"/trip\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Your guest travel details and weekend plans →</span></a></p></div></div></section><section id=\"airports\" class=\"gh-section gh-section--default\" aria-labelledby=\"airports-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Two airports serve Chicago\"><div class=\"gh-section__inner\"><div class=\"gh-section__head\"><hr class=\"gh-divider\" data-bl-s=\"\"><h2 id=\"airports-title\" class=\"gh-h gh-h--2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Two airports serve Chicago</span></h2></div><div class=\"gh-travel__airports\"><article class=\"gh-card\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"ORD\"><div class=\"gh-card__inner\"><span class=\"gh-card__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">O'Hare International Airport</span></span><h3 class=\"gh-card__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">ORD</span></h3><div class=\"gh-card__body\"><div class=\"gh-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We recommend flying into O’Hare. There is no wedding shuttle; take the CTA Blue Line “L” train into downtown. Rideshare pickup details are coming soon; Uber can take you from the airport to the hotel.</span></p></div></div></div></article><article class=\"gh-card\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"MDW\"><div class=\"gh-card__inner\"><span class=\"gh-card__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Chicago Midway International Airport</span></span><h3 class=\"gh-card__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">MDW</span></h3><div class=\"gh-card__body\"><div class=\"gh-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Midway also serves Chicago with trains, taxis, and rideshare into downtown.</span></p></div></div></div></article></div></div></section><section id=\"stay\" class=\"gh-section gh-section--alt\" aria-labelledby=\"stay-title\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Where to stay\"><div class=\"gh-section__inner\"><div class=\"gh-section__head\"><hr class=\"gh-divider\" data-bl-s=\"\"><h2 id=\"stay-title\" class=\"gh-h gh-h--2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Where to stay</span></h2></div><article class=\"gh-card gh-card--featured\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"Chicago Athletic Association Hotel\"><div class=\"gh-card__inner\" data-bl-s=\"\"><h3 class=\"gh-card__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Chicago Athletic Association Hotel</span></h3><div class=\"gh-card__body\"><div class=\"gh-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The wedding is here, so staying here means no travel on the day.</span></p><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Call 844-312-2221 to book with group code G-FIKE.</span></p></div><dl class=\"gh-stats\"><div class=\"gh-stat\" data-bl-b=\"\"><dt class=\"gh-stat__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Group rate</span></dt><dd class=\"gh-stat__value\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">$331–371/night</span></dd></div><div class=\"gh-stat\" data-bl-b=\"\"><dt class=\"gh-stat__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Book by</span></dt><dd class=\"gh-stat__value\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Tuesday, June 15, 2027</span></dd></div><div class=\"gh-stat\" data-bl-b=\"\"><dt class=\"gh-stat__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Block dates</span></dt><dd class=\"gh-stat__value\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Friday, July 16, 2027 to Sunday, July 18, 2027</span></dd></div><div class=\"gh-stat\" data-bl-b=\"\"><dt class=\"gh-