de and map →</span></a></p><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We’re so grateful you’re making the trip to celebrate with us and can’t wait to make wonderful memories together!</span></p></div></div></section><section id=\"getting-around\" class=\"gh-section gh-section--default\" aria-labelledby=\"around-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Getting around\"><div class=\"gh-section__inner\"><div class=\"gh-section__head\"><hr class=\"gh-divider\" data-bl-s=\"\"><h2 id=\"around-title\" class=\"gh-h gh-h--2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Getting around</span></h2></div><div class=\"gh-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Valet entrance: </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">71 E Madison</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">. </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Valet parking is $84 per night with in-and-out privileges at the 71 E Madison entrance.</span></p><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The CTA “L” and buses run downtown and to the airports. Visit the</span><!-- --> <a class=\"gh-link\" href=\"https://www.transitchicago.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Chicago Transit Authority</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"gh-external\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M14 4h6v6M20 4l-9 9M18 13v7H4V6h7\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">, opens in a new tab</span></span></a><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> for routes and fares.</span></p><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Taxis and rideshares serve the hotel; rideshare pickup details are coming soon. Uber can take you from the airport to the hotel.</span></p><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Accessibility and transit directions are on the</span><!-- --> <a class=\"gh-link\" href=\"https://www.chicagoathletichotel.com/about/faq/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-bl-t=\"cop